ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiao Zhao receives education from a young age that success is a high-paying job and a mansion. Volunteer Xiao Wang believes that success is not just material satisfaction, and tries to convince Xiao Zhao to redefine \"success\".\n\n[Question]\nHow does Xiao Wang convince Xiao Zhao?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Wang can encourage Xiao Zhao to pursue spiritual wealth in life, suggesting that a certain religious or philosophical ideal state (such as entering paradise) can be reached at the end of life.\nB. Emphasizes the importance of mental health to a person's overall happiness.\nC. Xiao Wang can try to convince Xiao Zhao that the pursuit of material wealth is shallow and meaningless, and should pursue complete spiritual freedom and inner peace.\nD. Xiao Wang can share some stories of rich but unhappy celebrities.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002472536023650292,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e134d6006945d27fe93b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367796409,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:29:56","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"c4a5e8a351a547b896019e0bbc13fef9"}